OL,3,GNEWSAMan's plea after CPR saved his
OL,4,Alife on court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who suffered a cardiac arrest
OL,7,Fduring a basketball game said he wants
OL,8,Fmore people to learn life-saving CPR.
OL,10,FJack Taylor, 19, was playing with
OL,11,Ffriends at a leisure centre in East
OL,12,FLeake when he collapsed on the court in
OL,13,FFebruary 2024.
OL,15,FAn off-duty British Red Cross first aid
OL,16,Finstructor, who happened to be at the
OL,17,Fleisure centre at the time, began CPR
OL,18,Fand used an on-site defibrillator while
OL,19,Fhis friend called an ambulance, helping
OL,20,Fto save Taylor's life.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
